	(text "In the previous version the SD_CS was connected on the pin A0.\nIn that case a solder jumper as to be done on the SD board.\nSee https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-microsd-card-bff/pinouts#pin-select-solder-jumpers-3137566"
